/// Report the Custos capabilities the *configured* PDS advertises, so the create flow can
/// refuse honestly and early instead of failing deep inside the ceremony.
///
/// Creating a brand-new identity is Custos-structural, not merely Custos-flavored: the
/// genesis op has to carry rotation keys the wallet authored, and `createAccount` gives a
/// client no way to express that. Only a host offering the `/v1/*` ceremony can do it. So
